Sentinel: apps/web has no Vite build yet.

While this file exists, .github/workflows/pages.yml deploys a one-page
placeholder instead of a real build.

PR 3 ("App without the map") MUST DELETE THIS FILE in the same commit that adds
the `build` script to apps/web/package.json. Once it is gone, a failing build
fails the Pages workflow instead of silently deploying the placeholder over the
live site.
